{"k":"tri","t":"Properties & Solutions of Triangles","cls":"11","u":"Trigonometry","s":[["Basic rules",[{"q":"Sine rule","f":"\\frac a{\\sin A}=\\frac b{\\sin B}=\\frac c{\\sin C}=2R","d":"Draw the circumcircle; the chord $BC=a$ subtends angle $A$ at the circumference, so $a=2R\\sin A$."},{"q":"Cosine rule","f":"\\cos A=\\frac{b^2+c^2-a^2}{2bc}","n":"$a^2=b^2+c^2-2bc\\cos A$."},{"q":"Projection rule","f":"a=b\\cos C+c\\cos B"},{"q":"Napier's analogy (tangent rule)","f":"\\tan\\frac{B-C}2=\\frac{b-c}{b+c}\\cot\\frac A2"},{"q":"Half-angle formulae","f":"\\sin\\frac A2=\\sqrt{\\frac{(s-b)(s-c)}{bc}},\\quad\\cos\\frac A2=\\sqrt{\\frac{s(s-a)}{bc}},\\quad\\tan\\frac A2=\\sqrt{\\frac{(s-b)(s-c)}{s(s-a)}}","n":"$s=\\frac{a+b+c}2$. Also $\\tan\\frac A2=\\frac{\\Delta}{s(s-a)}=\\frac r{s-a}$."},{"q":"Cosine rule in all three forms","f":"\\cos B=\\frac{c^2+a^2-b^2}{2ca},\\qquad\\cos C=\\frac{a^2+b^2-c^2}{2ab}"},{"q":"Projection rule (all forms)","f":"b=c\\cos A+a\\cos C,\\qquad c=a\\cos B+b\\cos A"},{"q":"Napier's analogy (other forms)","f":"\\tan\\frac{C-A}2=\\frac{c-a}{c+a}\\cot\\frac B2,\\qquad\\tan\\frac{A-B}2=\\frac{a-b}{a+b}\\cot\\frac C2"},{"q":"Half-angle in terms of $\\Delta$","f":"\\sin\\frac A2\\cos\\frac A2=\\frac\\Delta{bc},\\qquad\\cos^2\\frac A2=\\frac{s(s-a)}{bc}"},{"q":"$\\tan\\frac A2\\tan\\frac B2$","f":"\\tan\\frac A2\\tan\\frac B2=\\frac{s-c}s;\\qquad\\frac{\\tan\\frac A2}{\\tan\\frac B2}=\\frac{s-b}{s-a}"},{"q":"Angles in terms of sides via $\\cot$","f":"\\cot A=\\frac{b^2+c^2-a^2}{4\\Delta}"}]],["Area",[{"q":"Area of a triangle","f":"\\Delta=\\tfrac12bc\\sin A=\\sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)}=\\frac{abc}{4R}=rs","n":"$\\sin A=\\frac{2\\Delta}{bc}$."},{"q":"Heron expansion","f":"16\\Delta^2=2a^2b^2+2b^2c^2+2c^2a^2-a^4-b^4-c^4"},{"q":"Area using two angles and a side","f":"\\Delta=\\frac{a^2\\sin B\\sin C}{2\\sin A}=2R^2\\sin A\\sin B\\sin C"},{"q":"Area in terms of $r$ and angles","f":"\\Delta=r^2\\cot\\frac A2\\cot\\frac B2\\cot\\frac C2"},{"q":"Area using $s$ and half-angles","f":"\\Delta=s^2\\tan\\frac A2\\tan\\frac B2\\tan\\frac C2"}]],["Radii",[{"q":"Circumradius","f":"R=\\frac a{2\\sin A}=\\frac{abc}{4\\Delta}"},{"q":"Inradius","f":"r=\\frac\\Delta s=(s-a)\\tan\\frac A2=4R\\sin\\frac A2\\sin\\frac B2\\sin\\frac C2","n":"$r=\\frac{a\\sin\\frac B2\\sin\\frac C2}{\\cos\\frac A2}$."},{"q":"Exradius","f":"r_1=\\frac\\Delta{s-a}=s\\tan\\frac A2=4R\\sin\\frac A2\\cos\\frac B2\\cos\\frac C2"},{"q":"Relations between radii","f":"r_1+r_2+r_3-r=4R,\\qquad\\frac1{r_1}+\\frac1{r_2}+\\frac1{r_3}=\\frac1r,\\qquad r\\,r_1r_2r_3=\\Delta^2","n":"$r_1r_2+r_2r_3+r_3r_1=s^2$."},{"q":"Exradii in terms of $s$","f":"r_1=s\\tan\\frac A2,\\quad r_2=s\\tan\\frac B2,\\quad r_3=s\\tan\\frac C2"},{"q":"Inradius in terms of sides and half-angles","f":"r=(s-b)\\tan\\frac B2=(s-c)\\tan\\frac C2"},{"q":"Exradius products and sums","f":"r_1r_2r_3=rs^2,\\qquad(r_1-r)(r_2-r)(r_3-r)=4Rr^2"},{"q":"Reciprocals of altitudes","f":"\\frac1{h_a}+\\frac1{h_b}+\\frac1{h_c}=\\frac1r,\\qquad\\frac1{r_1}+\\frac1{r_2}=\\frac2{h_c}"},{"q":"Altitude relations","f":"\\frac1{r_1}=\\frac1{h_b}+\\frac1{h_c}-\\frac1{h_a}"}]],["Centres and lengths",[{"q":"Distances between centres","f":"OI^2=R^2-2Rr,\\qquad OI_1^2=R^2+2Rr_1","n":"Euler: $R\\ge2r$ (equality for equilateral)."},{"q":"Distance of incentre from a vertex","f":"AI=\\frac{r}{\\sin\\frac A2}=4R\\sin\\frac B2\\sin\\frac C2"},{"q":"Median length","f":"m_a=\\frac12\\sqrt{2b^2+2c^2-a^2}","n":"Apollonius: $b^2+c^2=2(m_a^2+\\frac{a^2}4)$."},{"q":"Angle bisector length","f":"AD=\\frac{2bc}{b+c}\\cos\\frac A2","n":"$D$ divides $BC$ in ratio $c:b$."},{"q":"Altitude","f":"h_a=\\frac{2\\Delta}a=b\\sin C=c\\sin B"},{"q":"Distances of orthocentre","f":"AH=2R\\cos A,\\qquad \\text{distance of } H \\text{ from } BC=2R\\cos B\\cos C"},{"q":"Pedal and excentral triangles","f":"\\text{pedal triangle sides}: a\\cos A,\\ b\\cos B,\\ c\\cos C;\\quad\\text{circumradius}=\\tfrac R2","n":"Excentral triangle sides $4R\\cos\\frac A2$ etc.; angles $\\frac\\pi2-\\frac A2$ etc."},{"q":"Distance between incentre and excentre","f":"II_1=a\\sec\\frac A2=4R\\sin\\frac A2,\\qquad I_2I_3=4R\\cos\\frac A2"},{"q":"Distance between circumcentre and orthocentre","f":"OH^2=9R^2-(a^2+b^2+c^2)=R^2(1-8\\cos A\\cos B\\cos C)"},{"q":"Distance of circumcentre from a side","f":"R\\cos A\\ (\\text{from } BC)"},{"q":"Length of the external angle bisector","f":"\\frac{2bc}{|b-c|}\\sin\\frac A2"},{"q":"Nine-point circle","f":"\\text{radius}=\\frac R2,\\ \\text{centre at midpoint of } OH"},{"q":"Angle between median and side / centroid distance","f":"AG=\\frac23m_a,\\qquad GA^2+GB^2+GC^2=\\frac13(a^2+b^2+c^2)"}]],["Polygons and heights",[{"q":"Regular polygon with n sides of length a","f":"R=\\frac a2\\csc\\frac\\pi n,\\qquad r=\\frac a2\\cot\\frac\\pi n,\\qquad\\text{Area}=\\frac{na^2}4\\cot\\frac\\pi n"},{"q":"Cyclic quadrilateral (Brahmagupta)","f":"\\text{Area}=\\sqrt{(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)(s-d)},\\qquad\\cos B=\\frac{a^2+b^2-c^2-d^2}{2(ab+cd)}"},{"q":"Ambiguous case (given $a,b,A$)","f":"a<b\\sin A:\\ \\text{none};\\ a=b\\sin A:\\ \\text{one (right)};\\ b\\sin A<a<b:\\ \\text{two};\\ a\\ge b:\\ \\text{one}","n":"For acute $A$."},{"q":"m–n theorem","f":"(m+n)\\cot\\theta=m\\cot\\alpha-n\\cot\\beta=n\\cot B-m\\cot C","n":"$D$ divides $BC$ in $m:n$; $\\theta=\\angle ADC$; $\\alpha=\\angle BAD$, $\\beta=\\angle DAC$."},{"q":"Perimeter and area of a regular polygon inscribed in a circle of radius $r$","f":"\\text{perimeter}=2nr\\sin\\frac\\pi n,\\qquad\\text{area}=\\frac n2r^2\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}n"},{"q":"Polygon circumscribing a circle of radius $r$","f":"\\text{perimeter}=2nr\\tan\\frac\\pi n,\\qquad\\text{area}=nr^2\\tan\\frac\\pi n"},{"q":"Angles of elevation from two points","f":"h=\\frac{d\\tan\\alpha\\tan\\beta}{\\tan\\beta-\\tan\\alpha}\\ (\\text{same side, } \\beta>\\alpha)"},{"q":"Ptolemy's theorem (cyclic quadrilateral)","f":"AC\\cdot BD=AB\\cdot CD+AD\\cdot BC"}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Right-angle check","f":"a^2+b^2=c^2\\iff C=90^\\circ;\\quad a^2+b^2<c^2\\iff C\\ \\text{obtuse}"},{"q":"In an equilateral triangle","f":"R=\\frac a{\\sqrt3},\\quad r=\\frac a{2\\sqrt3},\\quad\\Delta=\\frac{\\sqrt3}4a^2","n":"$R:r:r_1=2:1:3$."},{"q":"Sum of cotangents","f":"\\cot A+\\cot B+\\cot C=\\frac{a^2+b^2+c^2}{4\\Delta}"},{"q":"Equal-angle shortcut","f":"\\frac{a+b}{c}=\\frac{\\cos\\frac{A-B}2}{\\sin\\frac C2},\\qquad\\frac{a-b}c=\\frac{\\sin\\frac{A-B}2}{\\cos\\frac C2}"},{"q":"Type of triangle from sides","f":"a\\cos A=b\\cos B\\Rightarrow\\text{isosceles or right-angled};\\qquad\\frac{\\cos A}{a}=\\frac{\\cos B}b=\\frac{\\cos C}c\\Rightarrow\\text{equilateral}"},{"q":"Sides in AP / angles in AP","f":"\\text{angles in AP}\\Rightarrow B=60^\\circ;\\qquad a,b,c\\ \\text{AP}\\iff\\cot\\frac A2,\\cot\\frac B2,\\cot\\frac C2\\ \\text{AP}"},{"q":"Sum $a\\cos A+b\\cos B+c\\cos C$","f":"a\\cos A+b\\cos B+c\\cos C=4R\\sin A\\sin B\\sin C"},{"q":"Sum $\\sum a(b^2+c^2)\\cos A$","f":"\\sum a(b^2+c^2)\\cos A=3abc"},{"q":"$r$, $R$, $s$ inequalities","f":"s\\ge3\\sqrt3\\,r,\\qquad R\\ge2r,\\qquad\\Delta\\le\\frac{\\sqrt3}{4}\\left(\\frac{a+b+c}3\\right)^2"}]],["If this type comes, solve like this",[{"q":"If $\\frac{a+b}{p}=\\frac{b+c}{q}=\\frac{c+a}{r}$ is given","f":"a+b=pk,\\ b+c=qk,\\ c+a=rk\\Rightarrow a+b+c=\\tfrac{p+q+r}2k","n":"Solve for $a,b,c$ in terms of $k$, then use cosine rule for $\\cos A$ etc., or $r=\\frac\\Delta s$, $R=\\frac{abc}{4\\Delta}$.","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"},{"q":"If sides are in GP / AP and existence is asked","f":"\\text{triangle inequality: } a+b>c\\ \\text{for all three}","n":"For $5,5r,5r^2$: $1+r>r^2$ and $r+r^2>1$ ⇒ $\\frac{\\sqrt5-1}2<r<\\frac{\\sqrt5+1}2$.","p":"3 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 3 times"},{"q":"If two sides and an angle (or $R$) are given and area/side is asked","f":"\\frac a{\\sin A}=2R,\\ \\ c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos C,\\ \\ \\Delta=\\tfrac12ab\\sin C","n":"Angles in AP ⇒ $B=60^\\circ$. Use sine rule for the ratio $a:b$ to get angles.","p":"4 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 4 times"},{"q":"If a trig condition on angles is given ($\\cos A+2\\cos B+\\cos C=2$, ratios of $\\sin$)","f":"\\text{convert to sides: } \\cos A=\\frac{b^2+c^2-a^2}{2bc},\\ \\sin A=\\frac a{2R};\\ \\text{or sum-to-product}","n":"$\\cos A+\\cos C=2(1-\\cos B)$ ⇒ $2\\cos\\frac{A-C}2\\sin\\frac B2=4\\sin^2\\frac B2$ ⇒ $a+c=2b$.","p":"3 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 3 times"},{"q":"If heights and angles of elevation in a triangular field","f":"h=d\\tan\\theta;\\ \\ \\text{equal elevations from vertices}\\Rightarrow\\text{foot at circumcentre}","p":"2 PYQs (2019–2026) · asked 2 times"}]]]}